    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb opportunity to purchase a bright, well-proportioned one-bedroom apartment in the heart of Dublin City Centre. No. 2 Jervis Place is a first-floor residence extending to approximately 39 sq. m. The accommodation is well arranged, with an entrance hallway leading to a separate kitchen and a bright living/dining room. A generous double bedroom and main bathroom complete the layout, creating a comfortable and well-balanced living space. With the Luas Red Line practically on the doorstep providing excellent connections across Dublin and beyond. Shops, cafés, restaurants, bars, cultural attractions and entertainment are all within a short stroll. Combining city-centre convenience with excellent accessibility, Jervis Place is well suited to both owner-occupiers and investors, with strong rental potential in a highly accessible location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway                                          0.89m x 6.04m                  inviting hallway with hot press storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom                                                       2.53m x 3.26m                  double bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom                                                      1.09m x 2.52m                  partly tiled and fitted with a wash hand basin, wc, bath and wall-mounted storage.\r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room                                       4.29m x 2.83m                 spacious living and dining area.\r\n\r\nKitchen                                                          1.62m x 2.42m                 fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, tiled flooring and a tiled splashback."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Located moments from Henry Street, O’Connell Street and Jervis Shopping Centre.\r\nThe Rotunda Hospital is within easy walking distance.\r\nElectric storage heating throughout.\r\nWell suited to both owner-occupiers and investors alike.\r\nTechnical University Dublin & Trinity college within walking distance.\r\nExcellent public transport links."
      },
      {
